      "widgets_values": [
        "The video opens with a close-up of a dark, imposing figure adorned in elaborate black and gold attire. The character is shirtless, showcasing muscular abs beneath an ornate necklace featuring a red gemstone pendant that dangles prominently over the chest. They wear large feathered shoulder pads attached to a flowing cloak lined with fur trim around the neck area.\n\nIn their right hand, they grip a staff topped with a glowing crimson crystal encased within chains, from which wisps of smoke curl upwards into the misty background sky where raven-like birds are seen flying on the left side against gray clouds.\n\nAs the scene shifts dramatically downward towards nightfall at sea level under starry skies—where once stood only water now rises jagged spikes protruding menacingly above its surface—a powerful presence emerges: this same individual stands atop one such spike amidst others jutting out like broken teeth along rocky ground surrounded by churning waves below; behind them stretch enormous bat-like wings tipped scarlet as if ablaze during flight just moments prior when viewed soaring overhead across open ocean waters before landing back upon solid earth amongst these spires illuminated faintly through distant moonlight filtering between thick cloud cover creating eerie blue hues throughout atmosphere.\n\nThe next transition reveals floating circular objects resembling ancient runes or mystical symbols drifting mid-air near the winged entity whose full wingspan spans wider than ever visible earlier while perched confidently yet ominously still amid swirling purple lightning bolts cascading down vertically either side framing entire composition adding electrifying energy contrasted sharply calmness surrounding deep indigo seascape dotted scattered stars twinkling softly far away beyond horizon line stretching infinitely upward forming backdrop cosmic wonderment vast universe itself\n\nFinally zooming onto face partially obscured golden mask intricately designed sharp pointed beak shaped nose flared cheekbones eye slits emitting fiery glow bright enough cast shadow fall directly ahead revealing glimpses pale skin underneath long strands hair peeking edges frame ears elongated tips slightly curled inward giving feline appearance accentuated further delicate dangling earrings each crafted fine filigree pattern catching light reflecting subtle shine whenever breeze stirs nearby.\n\nBackground sounds would likely include low murmurs echoing wind blowing feathers, occasional cawing calls ravens circling high up, rhythmic crashing wave patterns hitting shorelines spiked rocks, ambient hums generated static electricity arcing lighting strikes illuminating immediate vicinity casting flickering shadows moving dance surfaces textures everything combined create haunting atmospheric soundtrack perfect accompany visuals unfold screen"
      ],
